<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK JULY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 3.94 BILLION.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK JULY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 3.94 BILLION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Monday the required daily money market liquidity balance for </p>
<p>the rest of the month was 3.94 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for July 30		     7,700</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for July	     6,520</p>
<p> Average reserves to July 27			  6,906</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    3,936</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
